| **Marugame Udon Museum** | Learn about the history of the famous local udon and sample fresh noodles. | 3‑3 Marugame‑cho, Marugame, Kagawa 761‑0001 | Free | 10:00 – 20:00 | Great for a quick lunch break; the museum offers udon‑making workshops. |

